+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses semantic versioning (semver, MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for its release version numbers, a decision recorded on 2026-09-23 on the grounds that API compatibility matters more than encoding publication dates in the version, since the version number should signal breaking changes and compatibility guarantees to consumers.
